@startuml Resonance startup sequence
title Resonance — startup and command sync

actor Operator
participant "Docker Compose" as Compose
participant "ResonanceBot" as Bot
participant "Discord API" as Discord
actor "Discord user" as User

Operator -> Compose : docker compose up --build -d
Compose -> Bot : start container with .env
Bot -> Bot : load and validate token and guild ID
Bot -> Discord : connect with bot token
Bot -> Discord : sync application commands to test guild
Discord --> Bot : ready
User -> Discord : /ping
Discord -> Bot : interaction
Bot --> Discord : Pong!
Discord --> User : Pong!

@enduml
